e outcome\n02  Name the owner\n03  Set the next checkpoint\nNODESLIDE  ·  SOURCE-AWARE  ·  EDITABLE\n06\nThe decision\n1 source · current\nAdd slide\nEdit\nOverview\nCompare\n01\nCreate a six-slide decision review for a fictional sourcing pilot\nverified\nSLIDE JOB\nIllustrative pilot only. Review 100 → 120 → 140 units; reference 00123 remains text. Decision: prototype after checking the budget. 中文交接 — no external claims.\nCreate an editable, reviewable presentation from this idea\nOPENING / 01\nNODESLIDE  ·  SOURCE-AWARE  ·  EDITABLE\n01\n1 / 6\nPresenter notes\n25 words\n65%\nFit\nINSPECTOR\nSelection · none\nAI\nDesign\nNodeBook\nComments\nVersions\nEvidence\nJSON\nTrace\nAGENT ACTIVITY\nRun details\nSummary\nTimeline\nRaw\n\nProvider, work performed, validation, and human approval in one auditable run.\n\nCurrent deck validation: passed\n\nDeck v3 · publish ready\n\nRUN\nNodeSlide created the deck with its deterministic brief generator. The brief was not sent to an external model provider. Self-critique: 1 pass (deterministic route; self-critique loop skipped).\nCompleted\ndeck v1\nStarted 4:25:27 AM\nNodeSlide created the deck with its deterministic brief generator. The brief was not sent to an external model provider. Self-critique: 1 pass (deterministic route; self-critique loop skipped).\ndeterministic · brief-to-deck/v1\nRUN TIME\n1s\nTOKENS\n— → —\nCOST\nnot recorded\nVALIDATION\nPassed\n\nNo external provider billing was recorded for this fallback.\n\nExecution\n6 auditable records\nStructured timeline unavailable\n\nLegacy runs keep their custody receipt but do not invent span timing.\n\nAuthorization\nConsent not required — no external egress\nContext\n— unsealed\n5 context references read — attribution route degraded\nPlan\n— unsealed\n6-step plan drafted\nActions\nDeck built deterministically (5 tool calls)\nValidation\nDeterministic validation passed (v1)\nApproval\n— unsealed\nProvisional seal — machine only, not signable\nSelected trace validation: